MOVE 15 Hermes [11,3]
ENUN
StartBattle
NormalDamage(0,15)
MissedAttack(1,0)
MissedAttack(0,15)
EndAttack
FIGHT_MAP Maria 0x8e HandAxe False
StartBattle
NormalDamage(0,15)
EndAttack
FIGHT_MAP Hermes 0x8e IronAxe False
MOVE 15 Maria [15,3]
MOVE 15 Hermes [15,3]
ENUN
Text(ReinforcementsChaseMariaHermes)
MoveByCoords(30, 12, 1, 15, 1)
MoveByCoords(30, 13, 0, 15, 1)
MoveByCoords(30, 11, 0, 15, 1)
ENUN
STAL 60
Text(NoirAppointsCecil)
MOVE 15 Noir [0,4]
MOVE 15 Schwarze [0,5]
MOVE 15 Cecil [6,3]
ENUN
MoveByCoords(30, 4, 3, 3, 3)
MoveByCoords(30, 7, 2, 6, 2)
ENUN
