REMOVEALL_BLUE
REMOVEALL_GREEN
REMOVEALL_RED
LOMA 0x00 //Main event
ENUT 0xEF
LOAD1 1 EnemyUnits
ENUN
LOAD1 1 VelkaEncounter
ENUN
ENUF 0xEF
CALL 0x08591F40 //For some reason, there are TWO fade ins here, even though I've set them exactly how the original hack did it. If I remove this, the REDAs don't work. If I add it, it looks really weird. I will fix this later.
LOAD1 1 Units1
ENUN
LOAD1 1 MapAllies1
ENUN
CURSOR [10,3]
STAL 60
REMOVE_CURSORS
